cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project in research or teaching, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "Ambassador: Event-Driven Affiliate Platform in Go"
abstract: >-
  Ambassador is an open-source, event-driven microservices reference platform
  for affiliate and ambassador programs. It includes Go services for identity,
  administration, ambassador links, checkout, and email; MySQL persistence;
  Redis rankings; Kafka events; Stripe Checkout integration; Docker and
  Kubernetes deployment assets; and an interactive product experience that
  runs entirely in the browser.
